return {metrics,formula:`GST = taxable value × ${pct(rate*100)}. For an inclusive amount, taxable value = inclusive amount ÷ (1 + GST rate). ${type==="cgstsgst"?"CGST and SGST/UTGST are displayed as equal halves for arithmetic only.":"IGST is displayed as the full GST amount."}`,note:"The calculator does arithmetic only. GST classification, place of supply, exemptions, valuation and the legally applicable rate must be verified. For CGST + SGST/UTGST, the equal split is a mathematical presentation and does not decide the legal tax treatment."};
