return {metrics:[["Projected future value",money(fv)],["Total invested",money(invested)],["Projected gain",money(fv-invested)]],formula:`Monthly compounding projection. End-of-month SIP uses P × [((1+r)^n − 1) ÷ r]; beginning-of-month SIP multiplies that result by (1+r).`,note:"This is a mathematical projection, not a guaranteed return. Actual investment returns, taxation, fees, exit loads and timing can differ."};
}
